'''Radiant oathplate legs''' are [[oathplate legs]] modified by a [[purifying sigil]] and 2,500 [[aether rune]]s; the sigil is not consumed. The ornament gives no additional bonuses, and is purely cosmetic.

While the item is untradeable in its radiant state, it can be reverted anytime. However, the aether runes will not be returned.

